stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> QuestionReady
 QuestionReady --> Pending: Select option and lock
 Pending --> LocalFallback: Request fails or returns unsuccessful status
 Pending --> CorrectFeedback: Correct
 Pending --> MisconceptionFeedback: Incorrect
 LocalFallback --> CorrectFeedback: Correct local result
 LocalFallback --> MisconceptionFeedback: Incorrect local result
 CorrectFeedback --> QuestionReady: Next question and reset
 MisconceptionFeedback --> QuestionReady: Next question and reset
